# Sites and tags

## One `sites:` map

Each entry: `name`, `loc: [lat, lon]`, optional `tags: [str, …]`, optional metadata (`elevation_m`, `plss`, …).

- **No `type` field** — load rejects `sites.*.type` (“use tags”).
- **No goals** — no separate attractor type; all sites participate in viewsheds and P2P links.
- **`tags`** — freeform lowercase labels for serve UI filtering only (not RF switches).

Roles like `installed` or `planned` are **tags**, not schema fields.

## Links

Manual mutual pairs at top level: `links: [[site-a, site-b], …]`.

See [MEMORY.md](../../MEMORY.md) and skill `peaky-preset`.
